          "explanation": "dy/dx = 2x − 4 = 6 at x = 5.",
          "terms": [
            "math-ai-5.1-derivative"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "math-ai-5.1-1-q06",
          "type": "mcq",
          "prompt": "Find the equation of the tangent to y = x² at (3, 9).",
