            "y = 6x + 9",
            "y = 6x − 9",
            "y = 3x",
            "y = −x/6 + 9.5"
          ],
          "answer": 1,
          "explanation": "Gradient 2 × 3 = 6: y − 9 = 6(x − 3).",
