            "y = −x/6 + 9.5",
            "y = 6x − 9",
            "y = −6x + 27",
            "y = x/6 + 8.5"
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "explanation": "Normal gradient −1/6: y − 9 = −(1/6)(x − 3).",
          "terms": [
            "math-ai-5.1-normal"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "math-ai-5.1-1-q08",
          "type": "tf",
          "statement": "f is increasing where f′(x) > 0.",
